            <note corresp="#d690-f1" n="23" xml:id="d690-f1-content">
                <p>For index reference to the treaties of 1908, see <ref target="frus1908#pg_832"
                            ><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1908, p. 832</ref>;
                        <ref target="frus1909#pg_676">1909, p. 676</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d690-f2" n="24" xml:id="d690-f2-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Post</hi>, <ref target="#pg810">p. 810</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d690-f3" n="25" xml:id="d690-f3-content">
                <p>For index references to the Bryan treaties, see <ref target="frus1914#pg_1130"
                            ><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1914, p. 1130</ref>;
                        <ref target="frus1915#pg_1328">1915, p. 1328</ref>; <ref
                        target="frus1916#pg_1007">1916, p. 1007</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d690-f4" n="26" xml:id="d690-f4-content">
                <p>Draft treaties not printed; they were the same as the signed treaties, <ref
                        target="#pg688">pp. 688</ref> and <ref target="#pg690">690</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
